    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d564">

                <pb facs="0598" n="592" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg592"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Sir Julian Pauncefote to Mr. Quincy.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Newport, R. I.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-06-30"><hi rendition="#italic">June 30,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>My Government cable me to ascertain and report exactly what your Government and
                    that of Germany have agreed upon with reference to Samoa, in order that precise
                    instructions may be sent to British naval officers and consul. I should be very
                    grateful for immediate answer to that and previous inquiry.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Pauncefote.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
